WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.580
- [Narrator] There's nothing quite like

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:03.600
a hot bowl of noodle soup.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.490
In fact you might even say it's priceless.

00:00:06.490 --> 00:00:07.980
But how much would you be willing

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:11.128
to pay for a serving of
Taiwan's best beef noodle soup?

00:00:11.128 --> 00:00:13.730
$20, $50?

00:00:13.730 --> 00:00:14.563
How about $320?

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:20.087
(upbeat music)

00:00:20.087 --> 00:00:22.860
This is beef noodle soup...

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:25.060
a Taiwanese staple dish.

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:26.000
You can find it on

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.330
the streets of Taipei at a lot of places.

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:31.030
Like here or here,

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:34.080
and it will usually run
you no more than six bucks.

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:35.920
But there's one restaurant that has taken

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:38.487
this common noodle dish
to truly elevated heights.

00:00:38.487 --> 00:00:42.154
(speaking foreign language)

00:01:07.745 --> 00:01:10.666
- [Narrator] While beef
noodle soup may seem simple,

00:01:10.666 --> 00:01:12.983
it's all about the ingredients.

00:01:14.186 --> 00:01:17.853
(speaking foreign language)

00:02:01.571 --> 00:02:03.230
- [Narrator] As for the cost,

00:02:03.230 --> 00:02:05.830
it wasn't actually Wong
and his father who came up

00:02:05.830 --> 00:02:06.864
with the price tag.

00:02:06.864 --> 00:02:10.531
(speaking foreign language)

00:02:41.839 --> 00:02:43.180
- [Narrator] Funny enough,

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:44.990
as the restaurant's popularity increased,

00:02:44.990 --> 00:02:47.183
they actually moved to a smaller location.

00:02:47.183 --> 00:02:50.850
(speaking foreign language)

00:03:07.358 --> 00:03:09.713
- [Narrator] So if you
have the cash to spare

00:03:09.713 --> 00:03:13.093
see for yourself if this
soup is worth the price.

